    yolundad\u0131r... Gel telvelerine bak\u0131p \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    sekt\xF6r\xFCn, piyasalar\u0131n ve bitcoin de dahil olmak \xFCzere t\xFCm d\xF6viz
    kurlar\u0131n\u0131n nabz\u0131n\u0131 tutmaya \xE7al\u0131\u015Fal\u0131m!"
